### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@contentType = application/json

### Check scheduler status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v0/scheduler/status HTTP/1.1

### Manually refresh scheduler to fetch existing lobbies
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v0/collections/lobbies/scheduler/refresh HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### Cancel schedule for a specific lobby (replace with actual lobby ID)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v0/collections/lobbies/e013fda3-2949-4ec5-876f-727fba7e4566/scheduler/cancel HTTP/1.1


### Test Questions Data Fetch
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v0/collections/test-questions-data HTTP/1.1

### Test Matching Algorithm for Lobby
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v0/collections/lobbies/fcc81478-8e53-442b-8ed6-b8a4bde7eb54/test-matching HTTP/1.1